%97%E4%BD%9C%E7%89%A9%E6%80%A7"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zd5z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8a51a569-276b-4cf7-a99e-292aab24620d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"拡張子とmimeタイプのマッピングっていうウェルノウンな情報だけならば、日本の著作権ベースで議論するとそうなるかも。","ts":"1616732109.060200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+6GHD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6758fe4f-9d26-439e-9703-8f01e404359b","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"機械学習で使われる dataset とか普通に著作権あるしなぁ。","ts":"1616730377.060100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bsiU+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"442bb094-f3b0-4430-b872-8d55990cdc5e","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そんな事あるんだっけ。","ts":"1616730346.059700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ti2f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"db5eb4aa-01a7-4a8f-a868-11b3010a7d14","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/piro_or/status/1375107592603590657\u003e","ts":"1616730337.059300","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/piro_or|@piro_or\u003e: 今回問題になったファイルはXML形式の「データベース」と言うことができ、分類にものすごく独創性があるみたいな場合を除くと、日本の著作権法ではDBに著作権は発生しないことになってるので（他の国はどうなってるんだろう？）、日本国内のベンダーは気にする必要の無い話だったのかもしれない。","id":1,"author_name":"Piro🎉\"ｼｽ管系女子\"累計4万部突破!!🎉","author_subname":"@piro_or","author_link":"https://twitter.com/piro_or/status/1375107592603590657","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/771004913719451650/EM0EJB5S_normal.jpg","text":"今回問題になったファイルはXML形式の「データベース」と言うことができ、分類にものすごく独創性があるみたいな場合を除くと、日本の著作権法ではDBに著作権は発生しないことになってるので（他の国はどうなってるんだろう？）、日本国内のベンダーは気にする必要の無い話だったのかもしれない。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616686172,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/piro_or/status/1375107592603590657","original_url":"https://twitter.com/piro_or/status/1375107592603590657"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bPhm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dc075f9a-35cb-4163-9a87-5b5893e62a49","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"なるほど CI でリビルドしたらエラーになるって話で騒いでるのか。","ts":"1616729694.059100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zkN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"75ed295a-67b4-4432-9a7e-aab5123d2f01","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"環境変数で指定できる様にしたんですよね。","ts":"1616729608.058600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Y="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d7a39ecb-2c8e-4532-9497-7e15cf6511eb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; You will require a copy of the \u003chttp://Freedesktop.org|Freedesktop.org\u003e shared-mime-info database to be available. \nああやっぱ含めない(利用者に自分で用意してもらう)形になったのね。まぁそれが最短か。","ts":"1616729438.058200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6X0J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe23c12a-2333-4111-82c4-9f286b39612d","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"レジストラに申請？","ts":"1616729236.057300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O5T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d62853c8-04d3-4d7b-82ad-cf9a9b02d0d6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"これ、gemsは消せたけど、もし消せないレジストリだったらどうしてたのかしら","ts":"1616729230.057200","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1616729408.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"riPOh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d06d54ec-ae4d-4e0b-9da7-542367a33f42","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Rails 5.2で追加されたのね。","ts":"1616729215.057100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blo